This package redistributes the "Rampart" PII NER model and its tokenizer
assets (assets/rampart-q4.onnx, assets/vocab.json, assets/labels.json,
assets/tokenizer-config.json).

  Model:   Rampart (nationaldesignstudio/rampart)
  Author:  National Design Studio
  Source:  https://huggingface.co/nationaldesignstudio/rampart

